<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Keh.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kehap</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kehap Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Lamentations</para>
  <para style="mt">Kehap Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Aipau laisiukwak de zi cai “tsaibai leidung”. Keraube au Jeremiah kera nzwa, nah pa au Jerusalem ngkapkedi de ziemne kehap.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hebrewme let gade au, 1, 2, nah 4 ga Hebrewme laisiukau ngkai-kena teu pedum mdeulu. Pesau kecumbe de pedum riakherok-herok bam nah pedum pekecumbe leune Hebrewme laisiukau keheci ge ndeu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremiah aika Jerusalem nah kerecaki ngkapzing kedide mning gai bam. Dede pa ma aidung pelane Kesamsang Tinggwang tutiak eh cilu. Tinggwang au mide ngaunggia kela ci eh Tinggwang dade ngaugia kiebi gai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem ngkapzing kedi (1:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang rata-kerelui kepei (2:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Keherei kecu mningkegai-Tinggwang da keregui kebam (3:1-66)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem kendu kehegwabe-cu keherei kecu (4:1-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang ngaugia kekie (5:1-22)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Ndaa mina puiting bam kela namdi de cu au zing eh ntumbam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Pa au hemipui ge nzwa dida, pa ndaa heleuh kengkieng ge liede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Pa au heleuhdung kakga hegwangpei napui ge teigwang, dede cu au kemei tei eh hebaang ga la dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Pa tingmui hap nah helungsia bamla, nah pe miakdui lwamie pebia gumpwa bamla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Pe mraime gede pe lung taumla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Pe zangme pelane pecu cwa dida. Penui pe ngauraume tei dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Magah nah kehereikelu caide, Judah mibaang tei ladi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Pa heleuhdung kakga lungla nah kemtak ngau luma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Pecu zui kelame pelane pedwa railu pa reicangla kedi dau.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Zion kemie lampui hapbam kedanemene hengyi tingdau migede gwang ta kedine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Pe kiriedung pelane mrwa dida. Pe cingkupeidung hapbam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Pe kemci releimedung suisia bam nah pa pe suisiacang bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Pe ngauraumedung ne pe mpaume tei dida; pe ngauraume lungyi dizeu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">RAMPAUBE pecu tei keherei gaida pe mau kekieedung ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Pena keceunadung pe ngauraume bang teila dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Zuyi au Zion napui dade tet dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">Pe hegwang napuidung au heti cehei luh peeilu kemakbe nzwa dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">nah penuide zuimie kelame dwa gade penui kengkieng gah eh miela dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Pa rei kecu nah ki kegah tingbadung ga, Jerusalem nsung luzie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">pa ndaa bam kela mabam pemikehung pelane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Pe minadung ngauraume ba ga kaumie kedi dau, migede pecu ngha ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Ngauraume pecu ngaulwe pa kapkedi nuineu di.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Jerusalem mausüt di, cine, pa mi kenneu ge nah kehera ge teidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Pecu rüt kelame pelane cu au pecu ngkaudi penui pa paulaa kedi ngau kelune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Pa mrah nah nreutet di kera tei.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Pa mci kemak au ngau hecili bam dida. Pa lung gwang kera ziemne cet ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Pe kau au siazu. Migede pecu pelung taumla kera gah.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Pa hapgai, “RAMPAUBE, Ih keherei kebam pielo, kedanemene ngauraume ngkieng zu dida!”<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Ngauraube anui mabam pemi kehung leune gage pe ba kai dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">Pa heleuhdung pe kerecaki ga kelüt ngauda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">Nnui penuide peu nnui kangbau kela heni ga lüt selo ajah kaibeu liede.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Pe mina leune tangku pei eh hapla.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">Penui ketyeipok ziemne penui kehung mabam de peu dida ciu eh penui ringbamlu kerane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">Pielo, RAMPAUBO, delwe acu ngngialo, kedanemene Ih kemta di delu.<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />Cide au nnui ziemne magede meda ni, nnui tetka kegwangme leune ziemne?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Ainie pielo keheibe de a lungrei acu teikeherei kegai lungrei nzwa bamni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">kehung RAMPAUBE ne pe rata benai acu teikeherei gai kecune.<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />Pa kehu gade a radung gage miheu langgai, nah cide acu gwa luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">Pa a pi ziemne helang ge kamgai eh acu teu caili lu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">Pa acu ketet eh bamla nah teimnei dila.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />Ih sam gikah kedidung ngwanggai au pe ba ne keu ncüt luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Cidung de za ncütlwe a ngwang gage kai luda. Pa a kengkieng tei mnei dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Rampaube acu penui ba gage kaibeu dida, nah Ih saplu ta dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />Rampaube ne a reugwa ngkiengtume pelane de kelien dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Pa reugwamedung de langgai a rehangmedung de tei ngkapdi kerane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Rampaube ne Judah ga minadung de zauniakbam ga nzwa tei kecai dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu14:20, 19:15</char></note><verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />Aidung ziemne Ih hap, a miakdui pui nlim eh lwa eh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">kedanemene helungtau kemlabe a dade mdei di, a keringria teucuh beu kelabe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">A minadung de ketet dida ngauraume ne acu ngam kedine.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Zion pe ba hwa nzaha luda; migede pe lung tau mlalu kera gah da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">RAMPAUBE au Jacob de twagwapung kebammedung de pe ngauraumedung dilo ajah kaibeu dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Jerusalem au penui ziemne mcikemak ge dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />RAMPAUBE au masang, kedanemene Ih pe sam de renia di de kecune.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Kingneilu, nnui mina pelane, nah a lungrei pielo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">A kemci releimedung nah kengkieng mipeidung hebaang tei dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Ih a zangme de qugai, dede penui au acu cwadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">A cingkumedung nah a hangkiamedung namdi gade tsai dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">penui ringlu kera ketyeipok pei keladau.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Pielo, RAMPAUBO, kedanemene Ih keherei bam dida; a za mrwacwa dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">a lung ga a nlung hebwakdi, kedanemene Ih samzai tei kemakne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Hegwale, kingtie ziemne mipui hap bam, kilung ga ketsai rünne bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Penui Ih hap kebam kwa siuda, dede migede a lung taumla kera bam tadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">A ngauraume pelane a reikwa siuda nah penui au nang cide tei kegaine penui suiyi di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Nang sampet kebeu keherei tingba de teugwang gaida; cu au peu penuide Ih nzwa lulo.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />Peu penui kenlienta leune n dwaga peu gwang lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">A mau ziemne nang a dage tei kegai nzwa penuide tei beulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">A mra kwadung au kiee nah a nlung au ndam dida.<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Rampaube au Zion napui de perata gade kemui kang gage kailu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Pa au Israel zuyi de tinggim gade kideu gage kelien gai dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Pa pe rata tingba benai pe pidaubam de nsunglu meda.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />Rampaube au Jacob namdung pelane mneu luda nah ngaugia bam meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Pe rata tingbadung dau pa Judah napui riekelu namdi de kelien ngkei gi dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Sipiekemak gade pa hegwangram nah cika kedimedung de kideu gage keliengi dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Pa rata kesia teu eh Israel kengkieng leune dangtüt dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Pa pe ba zetle ngauraume dwagade keucaili dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Pa miheu ge pe taiga maleune rudi kela nzwa Jacob de ru dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Ngauraume ge nzwa pa pe lakpi anui lamge ga luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">pe ba zetle le kap gai kera ntei luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Zion napui paiki ga pecu penui suiyi bam kela pelane de pa daptset ciau dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Pa pe lunghop mi nzwa ruigai dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jerusalem</char></note><verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Rampaube au ngauraume ge nzwa dida. Pa Israel de mneu luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Pa henidung pelane mneu luda. Pa pe kengkiengbamdung ngkap dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Pa Judah ga minadung dage lungrei nah kehap teingkiee beuda.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Pa au pe paiki de hegurie ga ki keceu gede nzwa renia dida. Pa kensim maadi de ngkap dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">RAMPAUBE kemci tingba nah Sabbath kenade Zion gade nsungta kera tei dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">kedanemene pa pe rata gade hegwangpei nah cingkupei kenade mlai di delu.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />Rampaube pe reca bam püt dida nah pe kemcini de sipie meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Pa pe hegwangbamdung tangdeudung ngauraume ba gage kai dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Penui RAMPAUBE ki gade hekwa sahbak kecu ge teigai da, hengyi tingdau naige nzwa.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />RAMPAUBE au Zion napui namdi rie teimsia di kera cet luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">Pa au kemdet ria teu nzang petlu da nah tangdeu teimsia kera gade pa pe ba keu caili meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">Pa hap kerane kudadung nah kirie tei luda; cidungde ngngwa kemta dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zion napuimedung aide Jerusalem namdi de rangbam</char></note><verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Zion kiriedung kideu ga kaumie dida; pa pe rieki radung teimsia nah tei kecai dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Pe gwangpei nah kedimedung heleuhdung kakga la dida, hezaibe bamsi meda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">nah pe caihakecimedung RAMPAUBE dade marengei ngau meda.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Zion napui hangkiamedung kideu ga mlei mene ntumbam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Penui peu gage rebui keliengai nah rosopai ba luda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Jerusalem relei kemcimedung kideu ga penui peudung keumie bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />A miakduidung ziemne a miak peta teilu tadi; a za nlaidi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">minadung napui de teimsia kedine a lungnetdung lwa hegwale kideu ga pet dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">namdibe gu puididung ga henamedung nah ngienadung mnei bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">a lungnetdung hangdeu gage kaigai pwa bam dida kedanemene a minadung napui de teimsia kedine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">henamedung nah ngienadung namdibe gu puidikidung ga mnei bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Penui penui puidung dage rang eh, “Mei penai zau daiga bam no?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">penui namdibe gu puidikidung gade rezam kedime ge nzwa kau zeu eh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">penui puimedung gu hekarak gade tsaidi zeuda.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Jerusalem ga minadung, Ih daipai n dage ranglu laino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Ih dai teu ncu keda lulai, Ih n lung teincieplu kerane, Zion leitin napoi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">N rezam zam au jaaidi lang ge dida. Caune ncu teimmi lulai?<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />N caihakecime n ziemne kemret nah kemta marengei ngau.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">Penui peu ncu yi dailu kerane n mau ranglia beuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">dede n ziemne penui kemret samdung nah kemakbe ncu peugai.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Lampuiki ga tetka kegwangme leune n dage henui tei eh bapeu gaila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">Penui nui nah peungum eh Jerusalem hezukeyi de nui eh ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">“Aipau namdi de deni penui ‘Hezuyi cangsiak,’ ‘Kideu leune ziemne suiyi’?” de eh qu kela de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:39">Mat. 27:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />N ngauraume pelane ncu henui tei bam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">Penui pieling nah penui rata eh penui gei geigüt eh ranggai, “Anui pecu teikau dida!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">Anui kwakebam de tingba aide da! Anui henai au cide ngaulu da.”<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />RAMPAUBE pa riem kelu de tei canglu da. Pa pe sam de tei canglu da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">Pa ncu ngaugia si mene ngkap dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">kedanemene pa ngauraume de peu ngkienglu eh suiyi peudi delu; pa n ngauraume kii teu cuh beu dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Jerusalem ga minadung penui mlung Rampaube dage hapgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Zion napui kiriedung! N miakduidung hereuki nzwa peu tingmui tingba lwa mie lo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">N katei ncu kerelui peu helo, mede n miak kena dede kerelui peu helo.<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Cuhlu, tingmui hapgai lo, tingmui zie pelane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">Mlung dui kerui nzwa Rampaube dwa gage ruigai lo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">N ba Pe dage hwa cuh gailo n name puidiki leune kuung ga mzeu eh tsai lai eh kebamme teilung ziemne.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Pielo, RAMPAUBO, nah nang tei keherei kegaime de pie gailo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Mipuidung pe name de tyei zie ni, hename penui nküt keludung de?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Cingkupei nah caihakecipei de Rampaube kemci kerecaki gade teitsetdi zieni?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Puidikidung rebui ga hecing hena nzwakap eh tsai zeu bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">A rehangme nah a relieme ngauraume kingtie gade tsai dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">penuide ngaunggia mene nang penuide daptset dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Nang qugai da, minadung de hengyi tingba ga kequ nzwa, a ngauraume acu twagwa, RAMPAUBE Pe rata kedi benai migede pak gailak mede ring gailak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Penui Ih hung nah nküt cuh kelu a namedung de teitset dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">A ngauraume ne nkap dida.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Ih au RAMPAUBE rata geutie kang gade keherei kengau pei deda.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Pa acu gwa gidi nah acu peu kebaabe ga be mene kemuibe ga tet.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Kesangsiakpe Pa acu mcau eh pe ba nreu adage kaigai dai dai dida, tingba zie pelane.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Pa a pumteih nah a geu de peu ki dida; Pa a radung teicum dida.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Pa acu tui kera ta teilu nah acu suisiet nah lungrei le twagwalu da.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Pa acu kemui nidung ga peu lungh, ndaa tsai kedimedung nzwa eh.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Pa acu tangdeu tei tegwalu nah Ih pak gai lakta. Pa a gu hetageuriadung tei rütlu<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />nah Ih qu gai nah kengha kie sahbak gai liede, Pa a kekie kingnei meihdi.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Pa a lampui tangtsu tangdeu le kamdi; Pa a lampuidung tei ngkoidi.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Pa au hegum ge adwa swa kera kwa kebam nzwa da, hingho ge mie eh mbai kebambe nzwa;<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Pa a lampuidung teu nreudi, Pa acu püt dida.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Tinggwang pe lakpi gaa lwe acu pwa pe lakpitsi baru teilu.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Pa a ngkeu pe lakpitsibung ga kebam lakpitsi le kapdi.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Ih a minadung leune ziemne henui ge dida, tingbazie pelane penui henui ketei nia ge dida.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Pa acu lungrei le peu kepui teilu nah kekaa dui peu acu sak kera ketang.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Pa peu a gei tsuluine gi, nah Pa peu acu mimüt gage teu keneu.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />A keringria au lungciep gah da; Ih suiyi daipai bi nsungta dida.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Cine Ih rangla, “A lungketie gah dida nah cine RAMPAUBE dade a keregui dede gah da.”<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />A rei nah a ki kegah, heiring kekaa nah a lungreidung nsung gailo.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Ih cide nsung züza bamla nah a keringria a lung gade hena bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Dede Ih ma aide nsungla nah ciziemne Ih keregui bam:<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />RAMPAUBE keku bam mui kela de madaude penlih gah nah Pe ngaugia de madaude cangdi lama,<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />cidung au tingcang ramsang heci lula; n kesamsang au dizu.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Ih rangla, “A mabam au RAMPAUBE,” ciziemne Ih peda keregui bam zie.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />RAMPAUBE au pecu kwa kelame dade yila, pecu peei kelamedung dade.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Zing de eh RAMPAUBE kelikelu de kwa kebam au yilie.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Mipei ge ziemne pa rehang dau ge hepüt kerüt de lialu kecu yilie.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />Peu pecu helungtie eh ntum bamlo, RAMPAUBE pe reu gage keherei kai kegai dau.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Peu pecu pemui rebui gage kailo, cika keregui bam de cilaklu.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Peu pecu kedapbe de pe bia peulo, nah peu pecu rang kemsia le kepui teilo.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Kedanemene Rampaube anui de kelungta pütti laklu,<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />dede pa lungrei kai gai liede, pa pe keku bam mui kela kepui gade pa ngaunggia zie.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Kedanemene pa pe mlung gade teikeherei mede minadung de lungrei pwa peu lama.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Kideu ga hebaangme leune de pepi kangga ge dau kecu,<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />Hutube dwa gade mina de kemzeube mlaidi kecu,<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />migede tutiak bam gade kemzeube mlaidi kecu, Rampaube ma cikenzwadung luulu gailak!<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Cauge ranggai eh cide tei canglu no, Rampaube ne ajah kai kemak cai?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Hutube Tinggwang mui gage de meni kesia nah keyi kenana de kegwang?<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Dainzwa eh ringkela keheibe de ncam laino? Dainzwa eh mige pe maudung ziemne saja kepeu dau ncam laino?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Anui anui lampuidung piegai eh cidung de kedak gelo, nah anui RAMPAUBE da cailigwang gelo.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Anui anui mlungdung nah anui badung tinggimdung ga Tinggwang dage hwa cuh gai golie:<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />Oh RAMPAUBO anui kemautei nah renia dida, nah nang anui mau gibeu meda.<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />Nang n katei ncu de rata le kezui lwe anui de gwazui mie, nang teitset nah anui de ngaunggia ma.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Nang ncu hemwa le kezuilu iciu eh kekie ket de peu kah lüt melu kerane.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />Nang anui de hangdeu ga ralie ge nzwa teidi nah heleuhdung kakga de mlaidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Kor. 4:13</char></note><verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />Anui ngauraume pelane anui de resetla dida,<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />kehing nah baih anui reu ga gwang da, kekau nah kengkap.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />A miak kena miakdui reuki lwadi kedanemene a minadung de ngkap kedine.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />A miak kena miakdui lwa züza bam zie, mtak mene,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />RAMPAUBE tinggim gade pie ngkei gai eh ngau kemaktane.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Ih ngau eh a lung kehereidi a namdi napuidung leune ziemne.<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Acu nruine ge nzwa kap kera peeidi caugame a ngauraume bi kecume ne; pe kieh ge de gah eh penui acu kap kera peei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:7">Lei. 35:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Penui acu hekwaki ge gage kelien gaidi delwe penui a reu gage tangtsukang sam gai,<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />nah penui peu duidung pui nlimdi, ciu eh dui a peu cuhdi. Ih rangdi, ‘Acu püt dida!’<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Hekwaki sing gade Ih n zi qu gai, RAMPAUBO.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Nang a kwa siulu, ‘Nkwen ngkuidi helo a nggia kekie dau,’ de eh Ih kerang dau.<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Ih ncu qu kegai benai nang gwang mna lu; nang rangdi, ‘Ngngi so.’<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Rampaubo, nang tutiak ga a mzeu rangbeu, nang a teilung kelibeu da!<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />RAMPAUBO, penui ada ge kemau tei kegai de nang ngaulu da; a tutiak beulo.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Penui acu rang kemsiadung, nah penui ciem acu kemmau leune nang ngaulu da.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Nang penui kekii samdung siulu da, O RAMPAUBO, nah penui ciem pelane adage teigai keradung.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />A ngauraume acu rang kemsia nah kemmaudung tingbazie pelane ada gwang bamla.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Penui dainzwa ntum nah sap cuh bi pielo; penui leidung le penui acu henui tei.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />Penui tei kegai rehi gade, RAMPAUBO, penui de saja peulo.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Nang penui mlungdung tei hengam tei zie! N reset penui reu ga peu bamlo!<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Nang penui de rata gade zuimie delwe penui de tinggimdung kang gade ngkapdi lo, RAMPAUBO.<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Kecak de hamdi zeu da; dainzwa kecak yitu de kedi dino!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">Tinggwang kerecaki tsukangdung puidikidung mbie leune ga zangrala dida.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Zion kehung napeidung au kecak yitube nzwa penui miwhung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">dede cu au penui tangdeilidung swa de whung swa mada, li keteibe ne teikelu.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Maiserung kecang de pe nah de nküt la, dede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">a minadung napui penui zaisia dida, kideu ketsai ga ruitiedung nzwa.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Hereu eh ngiena mleu pe ngngak ga kop lwe bam dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">hename ketyeipok kie, dede penui ziemne magede gah da.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Ndaa taktyei yitube tyei kelame cu au puidikidung ga mzeu eh bam dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">Paini yitube kai eh lung cuh kecume cu au mimüt hekwa kelu ga zeu bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />A minadung napui de saja kepeu au Sodom de saja kepeu swa de kieeki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">cidung de kau zette dida nah pecu ngha kera badung kette gah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken 19.24-25.</char></note><verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Zion muiteumedung au buising swade mci, tungdui swade ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">penui pumdung hega swa yiki, penui rehi au sapphire nzwa rebaha di.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Penui zu cu au miceu swade tiak dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">penui de puidikidung gade cilu meda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">Penui geu au penui radung ga kihkop dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">Cide au tsing kecang nzwa cang dida.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Kingtie le hereu gade teitset kedimebe kemzeu gade tsai kedime swa penui suiyi ki dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">Luh gade magede luhlütlu mene mzeu eh, mitmit eh gah kedimedung.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Hungkela puime badung penuikatei penui name de taktyei ziemne swa dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">a minadung napui de tei kengkap ting dau</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">penui name de penui ketyeipok teidi.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />RAMPAUBE pe lungka pelane liagai; pa pe rata süt kecu lungmpet gai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">Pa Zion gage mi twagai ciu eh pe bangdwadung de ru kaudi.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Kideu hegwangme de nlumlu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">mede kideu ga kelung keheibe de nlumlu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">ngauraume mede renia kelamedung Jerusalem kiriedung ga lütlu bui lie kecu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Aide ciciu dida kedanemene pe caihakecime maudung nah pe cingkumedung maudung ziemne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">penui kemzeume de Jerusalem gade teitset kedine.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Penui miakciet eh, puidikidung ga huii la dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">Penui hejai le penui de teihera sütdi eh migede penui niadung tunggai lakdi.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Minadung penui de sahbak eh cu, “Tettilu! Keherame!” “Tettilu! Tettilu! Tung so!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Cine penui huii ladi; mina heleuhdung kak gade rangdi, “Penui aika bamsi gai lakta.”<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />RAMPAUBE ne penuide tei zang dida; pa penui ma pie sita dida.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">Penui cingkume de rüt ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">nah penui hecingme dade penui zai keyi ge de liagai ma.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Anui miakdung sia dida, kengha ngaulu mene peei pwa eh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">anui gu reketbahm gade anui pie bam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">anuide keligai kelak heleuh gede.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Penui anui lampuidung suidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">cine anui anui puidikidung ga tetgai lakdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">Anui penlihbe au nna dida nah anui tingbadung cangla dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">anui penlihbe gwang dida.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Anui de zui kelame au ting ga lingriedung swade mzet.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">Penui anuide lamlwatudung gage zui mie nah hetaideu gade anuide mie eh kwabam.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />Anui teilung bangbe, RAMPAUBE ne kedetkelu gwangpei de, penui biahdung gade tui kelube de pa da;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">pe ha ainzwa rang, pe mie kangga gade anui heleuhdung kakga lung zie.<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />N suiyi sütlu, Edom napoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">nang Uz deu ga kelungbe de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">Dede n da keherei gwang zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">nang sak miedi zie nah n katei nnia lwak paula zie<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Zion napoi, n saja de cangdi zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">pa ncu langgi ga peu lasi lakta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Dede Edom napoi, pa saja peu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">pa n maudung pwaliagai zie<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />O RAMPAUBO, nsung gailo, anui da ge teigai kedi de;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:1">pielo delwe anui ngngam de ngau gailo.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Anui mabam ci kemakme ba gage kaibeu dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">anui kidung sangme dage.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Anui ngianadung tei dida, anui pei kegahme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:3">nah anui puime au hemipuidung nzwa dida.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Anui rangkanggeu peu maisia anui dui kesak de ziemne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">nah anui rangkanggeu peu maisia anui katei gu tsingdiak ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Anuide cai zui kelame anui cai ga mna la dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">anui leeu dida nah anui kemtak ngaulu ma.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Anui anui katei de Egypt nah Assyria de peu dida</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">ketyeipok kennung ngaulu kerane.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Anui paume kemau tei dida, nah penui au gah da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">nah anui penui maudung ziemne keherei bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Hebaangme anui reu kedi teibam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:8">nah penui kengkieng gade migede anuide kelilu kera gah da.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Anui teilung kengngi gage kaigai sangne anui taktyei ngaulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">kedanemene mide teiketsetme hetaideu ga kelane.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Anui geu mimang ge lum kecu nzwa lum dida</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:10">mzeu sütdi kecu de ziemne.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Mipuime de Zion gade teuhdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:11">nah Judah namdidung gade leitingdung de.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Hegwangnadung de penui badung gade kezu tset dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:12">nah kecingme de herüt peu meda.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Rehangme de peu ketang eh mei keniak tsukang le peu mei niakbam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">nah mipeinadung tsinglwa kerütdung kangga mbeu bam dida.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Kecingme namdi rieki de püt dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:14">nah rehangme penui lei nah leibung de gi dida.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Anui mlung suiyi gah da</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:15">nah anui helim kelim au lungrei ge dida<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Hegwangpeurwa de anui peu gade nhai mie dida;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:16">co anui, anui kemau tei kedine!<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Aide ziemne anui mlung mnei bam dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">ma aidungde ziemne anui miak mangau mci meda<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />kedanemene Zion Deutuh mta mrwa bam dida, maiserungdung ne cika rwala dida.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Dede nang, O RAMPAUBO, kelungta hegwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">nah nang n hegwangbam ga ceheu ge cai ceheu ge eh hegwang tei zie.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Nang daitei anui de kelungta nsungta dino?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">Nang daitei anui de peting ketie ge gidi dino?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Anuide n da ge ngngwang dailo, O RAMPAUBO, nah anui ngwanglu zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">Ndaa nzwa anui tingbadung teiheci beulo,<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />nang anuide mlai cangsiakdi mecai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:22">nah nang anuide n rata penlih gahdi mecai.<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>